{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JQmm8oNNLu7sGrwTmNiN6k","type":"tool_result","content":"autoopt-results/task.md:3:[Omitted long matching line]\nautoopt-results/2026-04-15-2230-prealloc-whir-fold-buffers/plan.md:11:The WHIR inner sumcheck loop (lines 202-271) runs `k_whir × num_whir_rounds` iterations (4 × 3 = 12 at APC 300, m=24, log_final_poly_len=12). Each iteration:\nautoopt-results/2026-04-12-2330-batch-stacked-reduction-mle-sync/plan.md:127:        let stacked_height = self.stacked_height(round);\nautoopt-results/2026-04-12-2330-batch-stacked-reduction-mle-sync/plan.md:139:                stacked_height,\nautoopt-results/2026-04-12-2330-batch-stacked-reduction-mle-sync/plan.md:149:        let stacked_height = self.stacked_height(round);\nautoopt-results/2026-04-12-2330-batch-stacked-reduction-mle-sync/plan.md:158:                stacked_height,\nautoopt-results/2026-04-13-2300-batch-mle-round-kernels/plan.md:245:let stacked_height = self.stacked_height(round);\nautoopt-results/2026-04-13-2300-batch-mle-round-kernels/plan.md:257:        stacked_height,\nautoopt-results/2026-04-13-2300-batch-mle-round-kernels/plan.md:275:        stacked_height,"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01B2aXHfTFY1CYrURnDvPBve","session_id":"719c141a-1a84-4f89-a64a-f54435a4c1b4","uuid":"2b7594d7-627b-4d28-85a0-124095f0f429","timestamp":"2026-04-15T20:13:20.165Z"}
